    "long_instructions": "#Mood Board Design\r\n\r\nUse AI as a design partner to brainstorm and refine your mood board ideas.\r\n\r\nStart by sharing:\r\n* The brand or event you chose\r\n* The vibe or feeling you want to communicate\r\n\r\nThen:\r\n* Share any ideas you already have for colors, fonts, imagery, or style words\r\n* Or ask your design partner for suggestions if you're unsure where to start\r\n\r\n**Use AI to strengthen and clarify your ideas, not to make the decisions for you.**",
